 challenging route, it takes an average of 32 h 46 min to complete. This is a very popular area for backpacking, birding, and camping, so you'll likely encounter other people while exploring. The trail is open year-round and is beautiful to visit anytime.\\n\"}]","deleted_at":null,"summary_path":"qgiaHcvssBBMgBk@eBk@gBk@aBMaCAaCAuBe@uAi@o@k@cBgAcBgAeDmAeFyAsBm@yAUwAUyAUuEeAkBa@iBa@kGeA{AWyDo@}AWwBQcCAcC?mCj@qIiBwAa@yAc@qDeAwAc@kGgBkGiBwAc@yAa@wAc@qDeAyAc@wAa@aEkAmEmAeBa@iEaAcB_@eBa@yBo@yBo@mBEyEMiB?iBAgBAyDM}A}CyD{A{Am@uDqAwAc@cJmCqDgAqDgAqDgAqDeAyAc@wAc@y@cEj@uFm@eB{A[yA]wDw@yA]{A[mArAkAtAmArAmAtAyChD_E?aB?_B?_E?aB?_B?_B?_B@_B?}D@uF|@gBRgBReBTgBRgBRsAq@{FuCsAq@sAq@sBUqBWsBU}AG{AG}AE}AG{AG}AGyDM}AG{AG}AEwGWwGU}AG{AE}AGwGUyDO{AGyAG{AGuDM{AGuDOs@nBu@lBs@nBiB~Es@lBs@nBu@nBs@lBiB~Es@nBiB|Es@nBs@nBu@lBs@nBOFwD`@yAN{AP}AJ_BL}AJ{DX_BL}AJkEs@eBWeBYbA_F~AwEwAUmDG}CIqAq@uBc@gE{@eB_@gBa@eB_@eB_@eB_@WUMqBwAxAiB]yA[{AYyAYaB_@aB_@eE}@aB_@aB_@cE}@WsCyBg@fAkCfAiCh@oCj@mCgBIeBIoEUeBIgBIJoF}AI}DQyG[_BG}AI}AI}AG}DQ}AI}AI}AIyDQ}AIQzEeBIeBKeBIcBIeBKeBI?{EyDW{AKuGa@{AK{AKqBuAqBuA{@jB{@hB{@jB{@jBcEjAeB}@gB}@eB}@eB}@iC?gCk@c@pCc@pCa@pCc@pCwDVuDT{AJ{AH{AJ{AJuDV{AHqG`@wDVaEVaBJkBQiBOeHkAwD{@}A[{A]H{CJ{CHqD{AIyDQ}AI}DgAaB_AaB}@V}AmB_Am@~Cm@`DiFiCBM}@vCkBi@iBi@kBi@iBi@{A?yA?yAEmGOyACyAEyACyAEN_HVqLyDt@}AZiEzDoBViEb@yAL{AJyAL_@jF_BdByAWwAYqDo@yAYwAWqDq@sFi@}C\\_BQ_Ea@}Gu@_BQ_BO_Ec@cEYaBKcHg@aBKiEAeB?eB?eB?iEAyASyAQyASyASqDe@yASyASsDe@yAFyADyAFyADuDLsDLyAFmGKuDu@yA[yAYyAJ{AJsDX{AJyAJiDtAuAh@uAj@sAh@uAj@qI_Bq@nBiDvAiDvAmAzBcDaBmClEgAfBgAdBgAfBeAdBkAzA{DbD}ApAuFbEiFnD_AXuAdAuAfAsAdAuAfAuAdAuAfAuAdAsAfAkDlC}G`I_EnC_BfA_BfAmA|AoAzA{CxDmA|A}CxDiArAkAtAiArAuChDiAtAiArAkAtAiArAoBxAaEjDqApAsApAcDdDqApAgAzAgAzAgAzAmCtDoCvDgAzAgB?yAp@{Ar@yAp@yAp@uDdByBbDg@rJ{ADgAfBiAfBgAfB{D}C{A`DuBVsBVcCxC{@fC{@fCwBlGwAlHk@tCk@vC}BI{BK{CzCmAnAmAlAyEX_AhB}BpE_CrE}@fB_AhBq@bCo@`Cq@bCa@fDk@xPCdCCdCoAjHe@tCg@tCBvCDtCBvCmAjI}@|B}@zB}BxF}@|B]bHOpC]bHOpCm@tGWhCWjCm@tGo@tGWhCUjCWhCSjCSlCg@vGi@xGSlCg@vGSlCm@nGW`CYbCY`CYbCkAfKq@dG